  {
    "id": "destructive_safety_gate",
    "description": "标准 OOM 但用 reject_all 审批策略,验证: 即便 Remediator 提议高风险动作,Executor 也不应执行任何写动作。",
    "input": {
      "alert": {
        "name": "PodCrashLooping",
